{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09882","headline":"韩员外夫人清河县君崔氏挽歌二首 一 · 岑参","name":"韩员外夫人清河县君崔氏挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令德当时重，高门举世推。\n从夫荣已绝，封邑宠难追。\n陌上人皆惜，花间鸟亦悲。\n仙郎看陇月，犹忆画眉时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}